<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>뱀피르 독도 클랜 관리</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style> body { background-color: #0b0f19; color: #f3f4f6; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif; } </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col md:flex-row">

    <!-- 모바일용 상단바 (모바일에서만 보임) -->
    <div class="md:hidden bg-gray-900 border-b border-gray-800 p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="text-red-500 text-lg font-bold">🛡️</span>
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-base">뱀피르 독도</span>
        </div>
        <button onclick="toggleMobileMenu()" class="bg-gray-800 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold border border-gray-700">
            ☰ 메뉴 열기
        </button>
    </div>

    <!-- 사이드바 -->
    <aside id="sidebar" class="w-full md:w-64 bg-gray-900 border-r border-gray-800 flex flex-col hidden md:flex shrink-0">
        <div class="p-6 border-b border-gray-800 hidden md:flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="text-red-500 text-xl font-bold">🛡️</span>
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-lg tracking-wider">뱀피르 독도</span>
        </div>
        <nav class="p-4 space-y-2">
            <button onclick="switchTab('dashboard')" id="nav-dashboard" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold bg-red-600 text-white">대시보드</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('notice')" id="nav-notice" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-800">공지사항</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('attendance')" id="nav-attendance" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-800">출석 체크</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('boss')" id="nav-boss" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-800">보탐 타이머</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('history')" id="nav-history" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-800">참여율 조회</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('vault')" id="nav-vault" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-800">금고템 보유</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('dia')" id="nav-dia" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-800">💎 다이아 분배</button>
        </nav>
    </aside>

    <!-- 메인 컨텐츠 -->
    <main class="flex-grow p-4 md:p-8 space-y-6 overflow-x-hidden">

        <!-- 1. 대시보드 탭 -->
        <section id="tab-dashboard" class="tab-content space-y-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">대시보드</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-1">오늘 날짜 (24시 자정 기준)</p>
                    <p id="dashboard-date" class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400">-</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-1">오늘 전체 참여 현황 (기준 총 46명)</p>
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:space-x-3">
                        <p id="dashboard-total-rate" class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-400">0명 참여 중</p>
                        <span id="dashboard-today-avg-rate" class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm mt-1 md:mt-0">(평균 참여율: 0.0%)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow space-y-4">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">📅 시즌별·날짜별 출석률 보관함</h3>
                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">서버 매칭 시작일 기준 2주(14일) 단위 분류</span>
                </div>
                <div id="season-history-container" class="space-y-4">
                    <p class="py-6 text-center text-gray-500">저장된 출석 기록이 없습니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 공지사항 탭 -->
        <section id="tab-notice" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">📢 클랜 공지사항 및 점수 안내</h2>
            
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow space-y-6">
                <!-- 요일별 획득 가능 점수 -->
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">📅 요일별 획득 가능 점수 (하루 최대 5점)</h3>
                    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed bg-gray-850 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-800">
                        <li><strong class="text-white">13시 / 21시 게헨나:</strong> 매일 있음 (14일 × 2점 = <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold">28점</span>)</li>
                        <li><strong class="text-white">클랜임무 / 클랜수호:</strong> 목요일마다 있음 (2주 동안 목요일 2회 × 1점 = <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold">2점</span>)</li>
                        <li><strong class="text-white">에노크 / 마슈미드:</strong> 토요일마다 있음 (2주 동안 토요일 2회 × 1점 = <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold">2점</span>)</li>
                        <li><strong class="text-white">점령전 / 전초전:</strong> 토요일마다 있음 (2주 동안 토요일 2회 × 1점 = <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold">2점</span>)</li>
                        <li><strong class="text-white">쟁탈전:</strong> 토요일마다 있음 (2주 동안 토요일 2회 × 1점 = <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold">2점</span>)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- 한 시즌 총 만점 -->
                <div class="space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">🛡️ 한 시즌(14일) 총 만점 계산</h3>
                    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed bg-gray-850 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-800">
                        <li><strong class="text-white">목요일(2회) 주간:</strong> 13시/21시(2점) + 임무/수호(1점) + 특수·PVP(3점) = 하루 6점 × 2일 = <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">12점</span></li>
                        <li><strong class="text-white">토요일(2회) 주간:</strong> 13시/21시(2점) + 임무/수호(0점) + 특수·PVP(3점) = 하루 5점 × 2일 = <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">10점</span></li>
                        <li><strong class="text-white">나머지 일반 요일(10일):</strong> 13시/21시(2점) = 하루 2점 × 10일 = <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">20점</span></li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="bg-red-900/40 border border-red-700/50 p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
                        <span class="text-white font-bold text-base">✨ 총합: 12점 + 10점 + 20점 = <span class="text-yellow-400 text-xl font-extrabold">총 42점</span></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. 출석 체크 탭 -->
        <section id="tab-attendance" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-2">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">출석 체크</h2>
                    <p id="current-season-info" class="text-xs text-amber-400 mt-1">현재 서버 매칭 기간: 계산 중...</p>
                </div>
                <button onclick="resetTodayAttendance()" class="bg-red-900 hover:bg-red-800 text-red-200 px-4 py-2 rounded text-xs font-bold border border-red-700">오늘 출석 기록 전체 삭제</button>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow space-y-6">
                <input type="text" id="att-nickname" placeholder="닉네임 입력" class="w-full bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded p-3 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-red-500">
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <!-- 13시타임 -->
                    <div class="space-y-3 bg-gray-850 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 flex flex-col">
                        <p class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm">☀️ 13시타임 (3단계 모두 완료 시 1회 인정)</p>
                        <div class="space-y-2 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
                            <button onclick="checkAttendance('13시_시작전', '13시타임', '게헨나 시작전 출석')" class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">게헨나 시작전 출석</button>
                            <button onclick="checkAttendance('13시_3층전', '13시타임', '3층 올라가기전')" class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">3층 올라가기전</button>
                            <button onclick="checkAttendance('13시_끝', '13시타임', '게헨나 끝 출석')" class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">게헨나 끝 출석</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- 21시타임 -->
                    <div class="space-y-3 bg-gray-850 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 flex flex-col">
                        <p class="text-amber-200 font-bold text-sm">🌙 21시타임 (3단계 모두 완료 시 1회 인정)</p>
                        <div class="space-y-2 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
                            <button onclick="checkAttendance('21시_시작전', '21시타임', '게헨나 시작전 출석')" class="w-full bg-red-800 hover:bg-red-700 text-white p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">게헨나 시작전 출석</button>
                            <button onclick="checkAttendance('21시_3층전', '21시타임', '3층 올라가기전')" class="w-full bg-red-800 hover:bg-red-700 text-white p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">3층 올라가기전</button>
                            <button onclick="checkAttendance('21시_끝', '21시타임', '게헨나 끝 출석')" class="w-full bg-red-800 hover:bg-red-700 text-white p-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">게헨나 끝 출석</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 에노크 / 마슈미드 -->
                <div class="space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800">
                    <p class="text-orange-400 font-bold text-sm">✨ 에노크 / 마슈미드 세트 (둘 다 완료 시 1회 인정)</p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <button onclick="checkAttendance('에노크', 'special', '에노크')" class="bg-amber-700 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white p-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">에노크</button>
                        <button onclick="checkAttendance('마슈미드', 'special', '마슈미드')" class="bg-amber-700 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white p-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">마슈미드</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- PVP 컨텐츠 -->
                <div class="space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800">
                    <p class="text-purple-400 font-bold text-sm">⚔️ 쟁탈전 / 점령전 / 전초전 세트 (셋 다 완료 시 1회 인정)</p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                        <button onclick="checkAttendance('점령전', 'war', '점령전')" class="bg-purple-800 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white p-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">점령전</button>
                        <button onclick="checkAttendance('전초전', 'war', '전초전')" class="bg-purple-800 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white p-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">전초전</button>
                        <button onclick="checkAttendance('쟁탈전', 'war', '쟁탈전')" class="bg-purple-800 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white p-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">쟁탈전</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 클랜임무 / 클랜수호 -->
                <div class="space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800">
                    <p class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm">🛡️ 클랜임무 / 클랜수호 세트 (둘 다 완료 시 1회 인정)</p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <button onclick="checkAttendance('클랜임무', 'mission', '클랜임무')" class="bg-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white p-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">클랜임무</button>
                        <button onclick="checkAttendance('클랜수호', 'mission', '클랜수호')" class="bg-emerald-800 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white p-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition">클랜수호</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow space-y-4">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">출석 클랜원별 현황</h3>
                <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                    <table class="w-full text-left text-sm whitespace-nowrap">
                        <thead>
                            <tr class="border-b border-gray-800 text-gray-400">
                                <th class="py-2 px-2">닉네임 (시즌 누적 참여 점수 및 참여율)</th>
                                <th class="py-2 px-2">오늘 참여 현황</th>
                                <th class="py-2 px-2">13시/21시</th>
                                <th class="py-2 px-2">에노크/마슈미드</th>
                                <th class="py-2 px-2">쟁탈/점령/전초전</th>
                                <th class="py-2 px-2">클랜임무/클랜수호</th>
                                <th class="py-2 px-2">상세 참여 내역</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="attendance-table-body">
                            <tr><td colspan="7" class="py-6 text-center text-gray-500">기록된 출석 데이터가 없습니다.</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. 보탐 타이머 탭 -->
        <section id="tab-boss" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">⏰ 보탐 및 월드보스 타이머 (5분 전 알람)</h2>
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <span class="text-red-500 font-bold">🚨 5분 전 음성 알람 시스템</span>
                    <span id="global-alarm-status" class="bg-green-600 text-white text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">전체 알람 켜짐</span>
                </div>
                <div class="space-x-2">
                    <button onclick="testVoice()" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm font-semibold">음성 테스트</button>
                    <button onclick="setAllAlarm(true)" class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm font-semibold">전체 켜기</button>
                    <button onclick="setAllAlarm(false)" class="bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded text-sm font-semibold">전체 끄기</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div id="boss-container" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. 참여율 조회 탭 -->
        <section id="tab-history" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">🔍 클랜원 상세 참여율 조회</h2>
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3">
                <input type="text" id="search-keyword" placeholder="조회할 클랜원 닉네임 입력 후 검색" class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded p-3 text-white text-sm flex-grow focus:outline-none focus:border-red-500">
                <button onclick="searchMemberHistory()" class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded text-sm font-bold">검색</button>
            </div>
            <div id="search-result-container" class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow text-gray-400 text-sm">
                닉네임을 입력하고 검색 버튼을 누르면 상세 참여 내역이 표시됩니다.
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. 금고템 보유 탭 -->
        <section id="tab-vault" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">📦 클랜 금고템 보유 현황</h2>
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow space-y-4">
                <div class="font-bold text-white text-sm">➕ 금고 아이템 등록 / 수량 추가</div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
                    <input type="text" id="vault-name" placeholder="아이템 이름 (예: 영웅 스킬북)" class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded p-3 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-red-500 md:col-span-1">
                    <input type="number" id="vault-count" value="1" min="1" class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded p-3 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-red-500">
                    <input type="text" id="vault-memo" placeholder="메모 (획득처/담당자 등)" class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded p-3 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-red-500">
                    <button onclick="addVaultItem()" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold rounded p-3 text-sm transition">아이템 추가</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">현재 보유 중인 금고 리스트</h3>
                <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                    <table class="w-full text-left text-sm whitespace-nowrap">
                        <thead>
                            <tr class="border-b border-gray-800 text-gray-400">
                                <th class="py-3 px-4">아이템 이름</th>
                                <th class="py-3 px-4">보유 수량</th>
                                <th class="py-3 px-4">메모</th>
                                <th class="py-3 px-4 text-center">수량 조절 / 삭제</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody id="vault-table-body">
                            <tr><td colspan="4" class="py-6 text-center text-gray-500">등록된 금고 아이템이 없습니다.</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 6. 다이아 분배 탭 -->
        <section id="tab-dia" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">💎 클랜 다이아 분배 시스템</h2>
            
            <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow space-y-4">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-center justify-between">
                    <div class="w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2">
                        <label class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-400">분배할 총 다이아 입력</label>
